{14}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{15}{My name is Cynthia Boggs. I was born here. The men who envisioned this hell for those who refused to adapt to their society neglected to provide for the offspring of the convicted.}{My name is Cynthia Boggs. I was born here. The men who envisioned this hell for those who refused to adapt to their society neglected to provide for the offspring of the convicted.}{}{}{}{ }
{16}{This is scandalous! You've been here your whole life?}{}{5}{}{25}{ }
{17}{You are a bit of the long winded type, aren't you?}{}{5}{}{180}{re-5 }
{25}{Yes. It was not a bad life, as it were, until my mother died last year. She kept the worst of it from me. Since her passing I have become abused and treated like common property.}{Yes. It was not a bad life, as it were, until my mother died last year. She kept the worst of it from me. Since her passing I have become abused and treated like common property.}{}{}{}{ }
{26}{Can't you speak with Thorvald about this?}{}{5}{gf1058 1}{35}{ }
